xor (0.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Cross-platform Windows portability:
    - Replace POSIX mmap() with malloc() + fread()
    - Use Windows BCryptGenRandom CNG API instead of /dev/urandom
    - Link with bcrypt library on Windows
    - Renamed Makefile to GNUmakefile for Windows MSYS2 compatibility
  * Large file (>4GB) support:
    - Stream files in 1MB chunks instead of loading entire file into memory
    - Enable _FILE_OFFSET_BITS=64 for proper 64-bit off_t
  * Removed address/undefined sanitizers from default CFLAGS (not available in MinGW)
  * Removed CI badges from README

 -- Jakob Flierl <jakob.flierl@gmail.com>  Sat, 09 May 2026 04:27:00 +0200

